    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b2614fea31cd7527e84f6140",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "紧接着，天气骤变。\n正当我以为乌云正以玩笑般的速度在空中蔓延时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf55b4eab6dbfa609e0b81b631af34196ec389996c40dec1c9f83d52668ee5d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135001.json",
