    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f02a6438d632043ff0225753",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所谓“唯有苦笑”，指的正是这种状态吧。\n这场突如其来的、不讲道理的大雨，将所有抵抗的劲头都冲刷殆尽了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0e31095b0b700ced2276d7ba803c5de10d27646be1586e90a1cbe68ac102051",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
