    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6da1c6a91407b5aa7da15d27",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哈啊————…………简直像是和天空连在了一起……——\n那么……你打算怎么办？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d07005558e4d1bb867157e7b4497d664497e25ef46e07ab4d25afe2127ad1c57",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1135/storytimeline_041135001.json",
