    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c2c999555c2ad8d6c628a5e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……看来她正全身心地享受着这份意料之外。\n看着她那惬意的样子，不由得感到一丝羡慕——",
      "source_fingerprint": "44e077c8ddb8a0b372808d93549a69384f47cee4817214dbe48ab4201ef1da13",
