      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——那是某一天的事。『好想在杳无人烟的秘境，远眺绝美的景色』。\n这种强烈的欲望突然从内心深处涌现出来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d46d61c23850910de75ac96b083ef87167e6805ecfc3f3c0169dc5c48eeb2403",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
