      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "向着天空，竭尽全力地大声呐喊。\n与这场雨相反，心情正迅速变得放晴明朗起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f845688a04adfca8f517dfff0590264cd8f33609a2a63ae82ba1a623b73cd657",
